    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2 - Approval handler\nOnly the number in Config > ownerWhatsApp can trigger anything. Messages from any other number are silently dropped.\nCommands: APPROVE <ID> | REJECT <ID> | EDIT <ID> <new text>.\nThe Lock step flips PENDING to APPROVED before Gmail runs, so a duplicate APPROVE can never send twice.\n\n**Setup:** in the Config node replace YOUR_WHATSAPP_NUMBER and YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, replace YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID in every data table node with your `email_assistant_log` table, and connect your own Gmail OAuth2, WhatsApp Business Cloud and WhatsApp Trigger credentials.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 384,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5571aeb7-92e3-47e4-b3a7-9efd0eaaf029",
      "name": "Sticky Note cec5b85f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-304, 128]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Receive & authorize\nWhatsApp trigger → **Config** (owner number + phone number ID) → **Parse Command** splits the message or button id into command, approvalId and editText.\nThe IF only lets through the owner's number with APPROVE / REJECT / EDIT. Everything else is silently dropped.",
        "height": 334,
        "width": 920,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1c6cda28-0336-4aa3-b2be-8a901fe0f044",
      "name": "Note: 1 Receive & Authorize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [192, 128]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Look up request\nFinds the log row by approvalId.\nIf no row exists, **WhatsApp: Unknown ID** tells the owner the correct command format and nothing is sent.",
        "height": 326,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "0b5cbd2d-2d4c-482d-a846-e9f8d397ceac",
      "name": "Note: 2 Look Up Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1152, 128]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Evaluate & route\n**Route Decision** outputs: expired (past 24h), already processed, EDIT without text, reject, approve-or-edit.\nEach outcome is logged and the owner is notified. An email can only go out if the request is still PENDING.",
        "height": 282,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d8c8649a-72cc-4967-902f-9328ecae5bd6",
      "name": "Note: 3 Evaluate & Route",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1632, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Lock & send\n**Lock Request** flips PENDING → APPROVED (or APPROVED_EDITED) with sendStatus SENDING *before* Gmail runs, so a duplicate APPROVE can never send twice.\nGmail replies in the original thread, to the sender only.\nEDIT replaces the AI draft with your own text.",
        "height": 296,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7575f013-c601-4f48-90fa-eee7af476ddd",
      "name": "Note: 4 Lock & Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2096, 624]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. Verify & confirm\n**Verify Same Thread** compares the threadId Gmail returns with the original.\n**Log: Reply Sent** stores SENT or SENT_THREAD_MISMATCH, and WhatsApp confirms to the owner (with a warning on mismatch).",
        "height": 246,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "1862042c-5baa-4b99-835c-11f5676447d4",
      "name": "Note: 5 Verify & Confirm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2608, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Send failure\nIf Gmail errors, the row is marked FAILED and the owner gets a WhatsApp alert. No email was sent.",
        "height": 226,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "00cb190b-e724-43df-af08-cfe0f352069b",
      "name": "Note: Send Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2640, 816]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Hourly expiry sweep (separate trigger)\nEvery hour, finds PENDING requests whose expiresAtIso has passed and marks them EXPIRED, so stale approvals can't be acted on later.",
        "height": 262,
        "width": 936
      },
      "id": "ce339c46-2588-4b1e-94cd-4907256b899d",
      "name": "Note: Hourly Expiry Sweep",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [208, 880]
    }
